  "brief": "LONA briefing  2026-11-16 09:41 UTC\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWORTH A LOOK\r\n  Carry is +4.47% a year, below what the round trip costs to collect.\r\n      About 19 bp of fees on four legs needs roughly 5% a year to break even.\r\n      carry.mean_yield = +4.47%  ·  carry.legs = 2\r\n\r\nWHAT THE RULES DID\r\n  Funding is trending: SUI down 4 days to -26.28%.\r\n      A single day of funding moving is noise. A run of days is a position being built or unwound, and it is what decides whether a carry leg is getting richer or being crowded out from under you.\r\n      SUI.funding_annual.streak = -4  ·  SUI.funding_annual = -26.28%\r\n  The carry book got thinner: mean yield moved -1358 bp since yesterday.\r\n      Still gross of the hedge. Finding 012 showed this number is only worth what the spot leg costs to hold.\r\n      carry.mean_yield.change_1d = -1358 bp  ·  carry.mean_yield = +4.47%\r\n\r\nCONTEXT\r\n  No market in the universe is at a new 50-day high.\r\n      The correct book is 100% cash, which is the rule working rather than failing - it sits out about a third of all days by design.\r\n      breakout.count = 0  ·  universe.size = 20\r\n  Fully in cash.\r\n      breakout.deployed = 0%\r\n  Fear and Greed reads 10 - extreme fear.\r\n      Recorded for later testing. LONA has not established that this index predicts anything, so it informs no rule.\r\n      sentiment.fear_greed = 10\r\n  The breakout book is narrower than yesterday by 1 market(s).\r\n      breakout.count.change_1d = -1  ·  breakout.count = 0\r\n  Fear and Greed has moved -19 points in a week.\r\n      Recorded, not acted on. LONA has still not established that this index predicts anything.\r\n      sentiment.fear_greed.change_7d = -19  ·  sentiment.fear_greed = 10\r\n  Biggest moves in the universe since yesterday: LIT -10.28%, ZRO -6.32%.\r\n      LIT.mark.move_1d = -10.28%  ·  ZRO.mark.move_1d = -6.32%\r\n",
